{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-qwkly-api",
    "name": "qwkly API",
    "description": "Tests for the qwkly Flask backend (research → script → Suno music → OpenAI TTS → DALL·E visuals → FFmpeg render).\n\n**POST /generate** returns **SSE** (`text/event-stream`), not one JSON object. In Postman, view the **raw** response and wait for the stream to finish.\n\n**SSE events (in order):** `research` → `script` → `music` → `tts` → `visuals` → `render` → `done` (or `error`).\n\n- **tts** includes `{ \"skipped\": true }` when `TTS_ENABLED=false`.\n\nSet **Authorization: Bearer** if the server has `UNKEY_VERIFY=true`. Keys for OpenAI / kie / Senso live in `core/.env` on the server—not in Postman.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "unkeyToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "videoFilename",
      "value": "replace-with-filename-from-done-event.mp4"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "JSON: `{ \"ok\": true, \"service\": \"qwkly-core\" }`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET / (same as health)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/",
            "description": "Same JSON as `/health`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Liveness check before running a long **Generate** request."
    },
    {
      "name": "Generate reel (SSE stream)",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "text/event-stream"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{unkeyToken}}",
            "disabled": true,
            "description": "Enable when server has UNKEY_VERIFY=true"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"topic\": \"best morning routine tips\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/generate",
        "description": "Long-running. **SSE** events: `research`, `script`, `music`, `tts`, `visuals`, `render`, `done`, or `error`."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Download video (after generate)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/videos/{{videoFilename}}",
        "description": "Use `filename` from the last `done` event. **Send and Download** to save the MP4."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
